      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>  <br>It&#8217;s been a while since I&#8217;ve shared much publicly, so I figured the best place to start was simply by saying hello again.</p><p>A lot has changed over the past few years&#8212;clinically, professionally, and personally. This Substack is where I&#8217;m going to start sharing some of what I&#8217;ve been learning, thinking about, and working through along the way.</p><p><a href="https://youtube.com/shorts/DXrsJSkfCw4?feature=share">Here&#8217;s</a> a quick reintroduction.</p><div class="native-video-embed" data-component-name="VideoPlaceholder" data-attrs="{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;d4e3831d-fe52-493b-8e71-7d6a1491c641&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}"></div><p></p><div class="subscription-widget-wrap-editor" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://adamwolfpt.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}" data-component-name="SubscribeWidgetToDOM"><div class="subscription-widget show-subscribe"><div class="preamble"><p class="cta-caption">Thanks for reading! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class="subscription-widget-subscribe"><input type="email" class="email-input" name="email" placeholder="Type your email&#8230;" tabindex="-1"><input type="submit" class="button primary" value="Subscribe"><div class="fake-input-wrapper"><div class="fake-input"></div><div class="fake-button"></div></div></form></div></div>]]></content:encoded>
